<title>USA: McCurry hints U.S. budget talks may take weeks.</title>
<headline>McCurry hints U.S. budget talks may take weeks.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>White House spokesman Mike McCurry said on Thursday talks between the administration and the Congress on a balanced budget agreement are continuing and hinted that they may take several weeks to conclude.</p>
<p>&quot;We're moving forward with the talks,&quot; McCurry told reporters. &quot;They're working very hard and we'll see where they end up in the coming weeks.&quot;</p>
</text>
